Date: Sun, 7 Jun 2026 18:14:22 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 06/14] Fix: Web IDE Phase 2 - complete stability and protocol
 fix

- Resolved Go syntax errors in signaling hub and driver.
- Implemented robust Efun registration that survives SimulEfun overrides
  by using unique internal names (MUD_IS_WEB, MUD_REQUEST_EDIT).
- Fixed the 'Argument Shift' bug in input_to callbacks.
- Successfully verified the complete flow: login -> edit -> JSON delivery.
- Synchronized all fixes across both mudlibs.
